MarketLens is a learning and analysis tool. It does not place trades, hold funds, or provide
financial advice. Backtested results are simulations over a short window of historical data and do
not predict future returns. Market data is supplied by Alpha Vantage and is subject to Alpha
Vantage's own terms of service.
